"The proxy provider “%@” could not be decrypted: %@" = "代理 provider「%@」無法解密：%@";
"The proxy provider “%@” could not be downloaded: %@" = "代理 provider「%@」下載失敗：%@";
"The proxy provider “%@” is encrypted and the profile carries no key for it." = "代理 provider「%@」已加密，但設定檔裡沒有它的金鑰。";
"The request expired while waiting." = "請求在等待期間已過期。";
"The request was sent, but its result could not be confirmed. It will not be sent again automatically." = "請求已傳送，但無法確認結果。不會自動再次傳送。";
"The request's reply belongs to an earlier connection." = "請求的回覆屬於之前的連線。";
"The resolvers asked first, in this order." = "最先詢問的解析器，按此順序。";
"The saved configuration is damaged. Import it again." = "儲存的設定已損壞，請重新匯入。";
"The server answered %lld. Check the address on your phone." = "伺服器回傳了 %lld。請在手機上核對網址。";
"The subscription could not be fetched: the request timed out." = "無法取得訂閱：請求逾時。";
"The system did not answer in time." = "系統沒有及時回應。";
"The system did not take the change — the switch is back where it was." = "系統沒有接受這次更改，開關已回到原來的位置。";
"The system has not answered yet — the change may still take. The switch shows what you asked for; the next Connect applies it again." = "系統還沒有回應，這次更改可能仍會生效。開關顯示的是你要的狀態；下一次按「連線」時會再套用一次。";
"The tunnel is not running" = "通道未執行";
"The tunnel refused: %@" = "通道拒絕了請求：%@";
"The tunnel request is invalid." = "通道請求無效。";
"The tunnel request queue is full." = "通道請求佇列已滿。";
"The tunnel stopped before it came up." = "通道在建立前就停止了。";
"The tunnel stopped on its own. Connect again to bring it back." = "通道自行停止了。再次連線即可恢復。";
"The tunnel's own resolvers, as the profile names them." = "通道自己的解析器，按設定檔中的寫法。";
"The tunnel's own resolvers, as the profile names them. Not a system DNS setting — an Apple TV has none to change; the policy editor stays on your phone." = "通道自己的解析器，按設定檔中的寫法。這不是系統 DNS 設定——Apple TV 沒有可改的系統 DNS；策略編輯器留在手機上。";
"These are the tunnel's own resolvers, from the profile — not a system DNS setting. An Apple TV has none to change; the policy editor stays on your phone." = "這些是通道自己的解析器，來自設定檔——不是系統 DNS 設定。Apple TV 沒有可改的系統 DNS；策略編輯器留在手機上。";
"This address is already in the list, as “%@”." = "這個網址已經在列表裡了，叫「%@」。";
"This group picks its own member." = "該群組自行選擇成員。";
"This mode sends all traffic without a proxy, so proxy groups and nodes are not listed." = "此模式下所有流量不經過代理，因此不列出代理群組與節點。";
"This profile has no providers" = "此設定檔沒有 provider";
"This profile is no longer on this Apple TV." = "這個設定檔已不在這台 Apple TV 上。";
"This rule tests which app opened the connection. An Apple TV tunnel only sees packets, never the app behind them, so it is loaded but never fires and the next rule decides." = "這條規則判斷的是哪個 App 發起了連線。Apple TV 的通道只看得到封包、看不到背後的 App，所以它雖被載入卻永不觸發，交由下一條規則決定。";
"Throughput" = "吞吐量";
"Timeout" = "逾時";
"Tunnel" = "通道";
"Type a profile address, here or on your iPhone. The address is what this Apple TV remembers; what it points at is fetched again whenever it is needed." = "在這裡或在 iPhone 上輸入設定檔網址。這台 Apple TV 記住的是網址；它指向的內容會在需要時重新取得。";
"Type on your phone instead — the keyboard is already waiting there." = "也可以改在手機上輸入——鍵盤已經在那裡等著了。";
"Update now" = "立即更新";
"Update unsuccessful · Choice confirmed %@" = "更新未成功 · 選擇確認於 %@";
"Update unsuccessful · Last read %@" = "更新未成功 · 上次讀取 %@";
"Update unsuccessful · Not yet confirmed" = "更新未成功 · 尚未確認";
"Updated %@" = "更新於%@";
"Updated just now" = "剛剛更新";
"Updating…" = "正在更新…";
"Upload" = "上傳";
"Use this profile" = "使用這個設定檔";
"User-Agent" = "User-Agent";
"Username" = "使用者名稱";
"Uses %lld local resource files — not supported on Apple TV yet" = "用到 %lld 個本機資源檔案——Apple TV 暫不支援";
"Using" = "正在使用";
"Utilities" = "工具";
"Valid session totals were not included in the reply." = "回覆未包含有效的工作階段流量總量。";
"Valid traffic rates were not included in the reply." = "回覆未包含有效的流量速率。";
"Version" = "版本";
"Version %@" = "版本 %@";
"Waiting for runtime confirmation" = "等待確認執行狀態";
"Waiting for update · Last read %@" = "等待更新 · 上次讀取 %@";
"What happens" = "會發生什麼";
"What is going through the tunnel right now, newest first, and which rule sent each one where it went." = "此刻正經過通道的連線，最新在上，以及每一條是被哪條規則送去哪裡的。";
"What the tunnel is using now. The system stops an extension that grows too large; if that happens, the item below prices every rule set and resource by name." = "通道此刻佔用的記憶體。延伸功能佔用太多會被系統停掉；若發生這種情況，下面那一項會按名稱列出每個規則集與資源各佔多少。";
"When the Apple TV is on and has a network, the tunnel comes up by itself — no need to open this app first. STOP does not turn this off: it only stops the tunnel until the next Connect, which arms it again." = "Apple TV 開機並連上網路後，通道會自行接管，不必先開啟這個 App。按 STOP 不會關掉它：只停到下一次按「連線」，那時它重新生效。";
"Whether the packet tunnel is up. Everything else on this screen is read from it while it runs." = "封包通道是否在執行。這個畫面其他內容都是在它執行階段從它讀出來的。";
"Which copy of the GeoIP and GeoSite databases the tunnel is using." = "通道正在使用哪一份 GeoIP 與 GeoSite 資料庫。";
"Which copy of the GeoIP and GeoSite databases the tunnel loaded." = "通道載入了哪一份 GeoIP 與 GeoSite 資料庫。";
"Your iPhone or Mac keeps profiles in iCloud: restore them here, or add one by its address." = "你的 iPhone 或 Mac 在 iCloud 裡存著設定檔：在這裡回復，或按網址新增一份。";
"download failed: %@" = "下載失敗：%@";
"tvOS guarantees 500 KB of storage and may discard the rest. A link survives that; a file does not." = "tvOS 只保證 500 KB 的儲存空間，其餘隨時可能被清掉。連結能挺過去；檔案不能。";
